WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.243
Wow! Who are you?

2
00:00:09.244 --> 00:00:13.008
I'm an octopus.

3
00:00:13.009 --> 00:00:17.566
Octopuses are mollusks.

4
00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:24.619
Mollusks have soft bodies and no bones.

5
00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:27.899
Where do you live?

6
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.575
Octopuses live in the ocean.

7
00:00:31.576 --> 00:00:36.450
We like to crawl along the ocean floor.

8
00:00:36.451 --> 00:00:40.181
You have a lot of arms!

9
00:00:40.182 --> 00:00:45.426
Yes, we have eight arms.

10
00:00:45.427 --> 00:00:50.366
Sometimes we lose an arm.

11
00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:54.768
But we can grow a new one.

12
00:00:54.769 --> 00:00:58.953
What's on your arms?

13
00:00:58.954 --> 00:01:02.619
These are suckers.

14
00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:06.879
Our suckers can grab things.

15
00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:11.123
We can even taste with them!

16
00:01:11.124 --> 00:01:13.968
What do you eat?

17
00:01:13.969 --> 00:01:19.077
We really like clams and crabs.

18
00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:23.938
Some big octopuses eat sharks!

19
00:01:23.939 --> 00:01:28.999
Seals and big fish often eat us.

20
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.388
How do you protect yourself?

21
00:01:32.389 --> 00:01:36.493
We can change color and shape.

22
00:01:36.494 --> 00:01:43.628
That helps us hide.

23
00:01:43.629 --> 00:01:51.960
We can also shoot ink.

24
00:01:51.961 --> 00:01:54.775
How do you swim?

25
00:01:54.776 --> 00:01:58.915
We use the water to move backward.

26
00:01:58.916 --> 00:02:09.031
First we suck in water.

27
00:02:09.032 --> 00:02:14.718
Then we shoot the water out and—zoom!

28
00:02:14.719 --> 00:02:19.074
Good-bye!

29
00:02:19.075 --> 00:02:26.083
Good-bye, Octopus!

